{% doc %}
  @prompt
    Erstelle mir einen benutzerdefinierten Shopify-Abschnitt namens "Beliebte Marken" 
    mit folgendem Aufbau und folgenden Anpassungsmöglichkeiten:
    
    LAYOUT & DESIGN:
    - Ganz oben eine Überschrift in Großbuchstaben, fett, dunkles Marineblau (#1F1F45).
      Standardtext: "Shoppe beliebte Marken"
    - Darunter eine horizontale Reihe runder Kreise (Logos). Bei vielen Einträgen 
      sollen die Kreise auf Mobilgeräten umbrechen oder horizontal scrollbar sein.
    - Jeder Kreis hat einen hell-lavendelfarbenen Hintergrund (#E8DCF7) mit einem 
      zentrierten Logo-Bild.
    - In der oberen rechten Ecke jedes Kreises ein kleines rundes Badge ("Patch") 
      mit weißem Text. Oben kleiner der Text "min.", darunter größer die Prozentzahl 
      (z.B. "-17%"). Badge-Hintergrund standardmäßig dunkles Bordeaux (#5C1A2E).
    - Klick auf einen Kreis führt zur jeweils hinterlegten Kollektion.
    - Ganz unten ein Button im Outline-Stil mit einem Pfeil rechts (→).
      Standardtext: "Alle Marken entdecken"
    
    ANPASSBARE EINSTELLUNGEN (Schema):
    
    Abschnitts-Einstellungen:
    - Überschrift (Textfeld), Standard: "Shoppe beliebte Marken"
    - Button-Text (Textfeld), Standard: "Alle Marken entdecken"
    - Button-Kollektion (Collection-Auswahl)
    - Hintergrundfarbe der Kreise (Farbauswahl), Standard: #E8DCF7
    
    Blöcke vom Typ "Marke" (beliebig oft hinzufügbar):
    - Logo-Bild (Bild-Upload)
    - Kollektion (Collection-Auswahl) – Ziel beim Klick auf den Kreis
    - Badge-Farbe (Farbauswahl), Standard: #5C1A2E
    - Badge-Präfix (Textfeld), Standard: "min." – wird kleiner dargestellt
    - Badge-Prozentzahl (Textfeld), Standard: "-17%" – wird größer dargestellt
    
    WICHTIG:
    - Ich möchte beliebig viele Marken-Blöcke hinzufügen können.
    - Jeder Block muss unabhängig konfigurierbar sein (eigenes Bild, eigene 
      Kollektion, eigene Badge-Farbe, eigener Prozenttext).
    - Der Abschnitt soll vollständig responsiv sein.
    - Erstelle den passenden {% schema %}-Block, damit ich alles im Theme-Editor 
      bequem bearbeiten kann.
{% enddoc %}
{% assign ai_gen_id = block.id | replace: '_', '' | downcase %}

{% style %}
  .ai-popular-brands-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    padding: 40px 20px;
  }

  .ai-popular-brands-container-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    max-width: 1200px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .ai-popular-brands-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: 24px;
    font-weight: 700;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: #1F1F45;
    margin: 0 0 30px 0;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .ai-popular-brands-grid-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 20px;
    justify-content: center;
    margin-bottom: 30px;
  }

  .ai-brand-circle-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: relative;
    width: 150px;
    height: 150px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background-color: {{ block.settings.circle_background_color }};
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    overflow: hidden;
    transition: transform 0.3s ease;
    cursor: pointer;
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  .ai-brand-circle-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover {
    transform: scale(1.05);
  }

  .ai-brand-circle-image-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    max-width: 80%;
    max-height: 80%;
    object-fit: contain;
  }

  .ai-brand-badge-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: absolute;
    top: 5px;
    right: 5px;
    width: 50px;
    height: 50px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    color: #ffffff;
    font-weight: 700;
    line-height: 1.2;
  }

  .ai-brand-badge-prefix-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: 10px;
    font-weight: 400;
  }

  .ai-brand-badge-percent-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: 16px;
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .ai-popular-brands-button-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .ai-popular-brands-button-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    padding: 12px 24px;
    background-color: transparent;
    color: #1F1F45;
    border: 2px solid #1F1F45;
    border-radius: 4px;
    font-size: 16px;
    font-weight: 600;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: all 0.3s ease;
    cursor: pointer;
  }

  .ai-popular-brands-button-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover {
    background-color: #1F1F45;
    color: #ffffff;
  }

  .ai-popular-brands-button-arrow-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: 18px;
    transition: transform 0.3s ease;
  }

  .ai-popular-brands-button-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover .ai-popular-brands-button-arrow-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    transform: translateX(4px);
  }

  .ai-brand-circle-placeholder-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    background-color: #f4f4f4;
  }

  .ai-brand-circle-placeholder-{{ ai_gen_id }} svg {
    width: 60%;
    height: 60%;
    opacity: 0.3;
  }

  @media screen and (max-width: 749px) {
    .ai-popular-brands-grid-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      gap: 15px;
    }

    .ai-brand-circle-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      width: 120px;
      height: 120px;
    }

    .ai-brand-badge-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      width: 40px;
      height: 40px;
    }

    .ai-brand-badge-prefix-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: 8px;
    }

    .ai-brand-badge-percent-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: 14px;
    }

    .ai-popular-brands-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: 20px;
    }
  }

  @media screen and (max-width: 480px) {
    .ai-brand-circle-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      width: 100px;
      height: 100px;
    }

    .ai-brand-badge-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      width: 35px;
      height: 35px;
    }

    .ai-brand-badge-prefix-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: 7px;
    }

    .ai-brand-badge-percent-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: 12px;
    }
  }
{% endstyle %}

<popular-brands-{{ ai_gen_id }} class="ai-popular-brands-{{ ai_gen_id }}" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
  <div class="ai-popular-brands-container-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
    {% if block.settings.heading != blank %}
      <h2 class="ai-popular-brands-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.heading }}</h2>
    {% endif %}

    <div class="ai-popular-brands-grid-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
      {% for i in (1..10) %}
        {% liquid
          assign logo_key = 'brand_logo_' | append: i
          assign collection_key = 'brand_collection_' | append: i
          assign badge_color_key = 'badge_color_' | append: i
          assign badge_prefix_key = 'badge_prefix_' | append: i
          assign badge_percent_key = 'badge_percent_' | append: i

          assign brand_logo = block.settings[logo_key]
          assign brand_collection = block.settings[collection_key]
          assign badge_color = block.settings[badge_color_key]
          assign badge_prefix = block.settings[badge_prefix_key]
          assign badge_percent = block.settings[badge_percent_key]
        %}

        {% if brand_collection != blank %}
          <a
            href="{{ brand_collection.url }}"
            class="ai-brand-circle-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
            aria-label="{{ brand_collection.title }}"
          >
            {% if brand_logo != blank %}
              <img
                src="{{ brand_logo | image_url: width: 200 }}"
                alt="{{ brand_collection.title }}"
                class="ai-brand-circle-image-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
                loading="lazy"
                width="200"
                height="200"
              >
            {% else %}
              <div class="ai-brand-circle-placeholder-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                {{ 'image' | placeholder_svg_tag }}
              </div>
            {% endif %}

            <div
              class="ai-brand-badge-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
              style="background-color: {{ badge_color }};"
            >
              <span class="ai-brand-badge-prefix-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ badge_prefix }}</span>
              <span class="ai-brand-badge-percent-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ badge_percent }}</span>
            </div>
          </a>
        {% endif %}
      {% endfor %}
    </div>

    {% if block.settings.button_collection != blank %}
      <div class="ai-popular-brands-button-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
        <a
          href="{{ block.settings.button_collection.url }}"
          class="ai-popular-brands-button-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
        >
          {{ block.settings.button_text }}
          <span class="ai-popular-brands-button-arrow-{{ ai_gen_id }}">→</span>
        </a>
      </div>
    {% endif %}
  </div>
</popular-brands-{{ ai_gen_id }}>

<script>
  (function() {
    class PopularBrands{{ ai_gen_id }} extends HTMLElement {
      constructor() {
        super();
      }

      connectedCallback() {
        this.setupAccessibility();
      }

      setupAccessibility() {
        const circles = this.querySelectorAll('.ai-brand-circle-{{ ai_gen_id }}');
        circles.forEach(circle => {
          circle.addEventListener('keydown', (e) => {
            if (e.key === 'Enter' || e.key === ' ') {
              e.preventDefault();
              circle.click();
            }
          });
        });
      }
    }

    customElements.define('popular-brands-{{ ai_gen_id }}', PopularBrands{{ ai_gen_id }});
  })();
</script>

